{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.063655033111572251,"h":0.013118268465925453,"c":1,"x":0.08418891044993404,"t":"Test 3","y":0.049418604928749943},{"w":0.31033533732096352,"c":1,"t":"READING PASSAGE 3","x":0.084064058720456386,"h":0.017394504153271373,"y":0.095625771682348093},{"c":1,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 27-40, which are based on Reading","x":0.084043902771888862,"w":0.82576283772786463,"y":0.13121788983413296,"h":0.022801270386462402},{"h":0.016224188790560423,"t":"Passage 3 below.","x":0.084188910618446994,"c":1,"y":0.15103244855982589,"w":0.17043121337890624},{"x":0.13552362451274613,"h":0.024778761061946875,"w":0.73511291503906251,"c":1,"t":"Is the era of artificial speech translation upon us?","y":0.19616519189395831},{"t":"Once the stuff of science fiction, technology that enables people to talk using","x":0.13141684216227276,"h":0.018940796753649791,"w":0.74127309163411448,"c":1,"y":0.2368731562346601},{"h":0.017525039380278828,"y":0.25427728617158007,"t":"different languages is now here. But how effective is it?","c":1,"w":0.54004104614257809,"x":0.23203286491639064},{"t":"Noise, Alex Waibel tells me, is one of the major challenges that artificial speech translation","y":0.29056047193162771,"w":0.77618067423502612,"h":0.017699115044247815,"x":0.084188923417147704,"c":1},{"h":0.019808392820105047,"c":1,"w":0.80096425374348956,"t":"has to meet. A device may be able to recognise speech in a laboratory, or a meeting room, but","x":0.082052119612656238,"y":0.30777753895060889},{"w":0.78477355957031247,"x":0.081979443797613197,"c":1,"y":0.32300536805200974,"t":"will struggle to cope with the kind of background noise I can hear in my office surrounding","h":0.022975711203605975},{"t":"Professor Waibel as he speaks to me from Kyoto station in Japan. I'm struggling to follow him","x":0.082135511085067878,"y":0.34302325630861663,"h":0.018923646369866542,"c":1,"w":0.80903493245442704},{"y":0.36137108024358089,"w":0.81122105916341147,"c":1,"t":"in English, on a scratchy line that reminds me we are nearly 10,000 kilometres apart - and that","h":0.018288009778588243,"x":0.080012836626890571},{"c":1,"x":0.082000720698972407,"w":0.81544621785481763,"y":0.37802823514191242,"h":0.020540257681787466,"t":"distance is still an obstacle to communication even if you're speaking the same language, as we"},{"h":0.021304658872891347,"x":0.079965122487438603,"y":0.3961905457230176,"w":0.8031112162272136,"t":"are. We haven't reached the future yet. If we had, Waibel would have been able to speak more","c":1},{"h":0.020398151769047357,"c":1,"x":0.079980265975921436,"w":0.78255910237630222,"y":0.41404613026768611,"t":"comfortably in his native German and I would have been able to hear his words in English."},{"y":0.45050305145806013,"w":0.80503377278645827,"t":"At Karlsruhe Institute of Technology, where he is a professor of computer science, Waibel and","h":0.019181290348019076,"x":0.082074170592504464,"c":1},{"h":0.019789716557415682,"w":0.8030447387695312,"x":0.079993924028478325,"c":1,"y":0.46741129485264521,"t":"his colleagues already give lectures in German that their students can follow in English via an"},{"c":1,"t":"electronic translator. The system generates text that students can read on their laptops or phones,","y":0.48366634220487759,"w":0.82574422200520836,"h":0.022198359171549442,"x":0.079964002604976936},{"h":0.01746844345137788,"x":0.080082123769459584,"y":0.50436046513999866,"c":1,"t":"so the process is somewhat similar to subtitling. It helps that lecturers speak clearly, don't have to","w":0.83367558797200514},{"h":0.0204403497476493,"y":0.52138336892968018,"c":1,"x":0.079986138043723162,"t":"compete with background chatter, and say much the same thing each year:","w":0.63673777262369791},{"y":0.55646037888815048,"t":"The idea of artificial speech translation has been around for a long time. Douglas Adams' science","c":1,"x":0.08001785532857629,"h":0.019608474551400579,"w":0.82968983968098964},{"c":1,"t":"fiction novel, The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy, published in 1979, featured a life form called","w":0.83384811401367176,"y":0.57401286781811245,"h":0.01970073283597773,"x":0.079989905253656554},{"w":0.81326644897460931,"c":1,"y":0.59127371699378539,"h":0.020559595608781622,"t":"the 'Babel fish' which, when placed in the ear, enabled a listener to understand any language in","x":0.080014214554735758},{"y":0.60865876693194232,"x":0.079930554406225748,"w":0.82576299031575529,"c":1,"h":0.021242851774952776,"t":"the universe. It came to represent one of those devices that technology enthusiasts dream of long"},{"c":1,"y":0.62780117747780939,"w":0.79281087239583337,"h":0.02051803453833656,"t":"before they become practically realisable, like TVs flat enough to hang on walls: objects that","x":0.079970795409693665},{"t":"we once could only dream of having but that are now commonplace. Now devices that look like","x":0.078028754111722567,"w":0.8234086100260416,"c":1,"h":0.016029532891107534,"y":0.64680232568805418},{"t":"prototype Babel fish have started to appear; riding a wave of advances in artificial translation and","x":0.079995410516135054,"y":0.66321040380293661,"w":0.82973622639973965,"h":0.020333543850609037,"c":1},{"w":0.15811088562011719,"h":0.015988371857499684,"x":0.080082134081576772,"y":0.68168604661430632,"c":1,"t":"voice recognition."},{"y":0.71730110605241804,"w":0.78041102091471359,"c":1,"h":0.018214258964786123,"x":0.080018664662279471,"t":"At this stage, however; they seem to be regarded as eye-catching novelties rather than steps"},{"w":0.80104797363281255,"y":0.73296852924523603,"h":0.021472023932983086,"c":1,"t":"towards what Waibel calls 'making a language-transparent society'. They tend to be domestic","x":0.077919613982889574},{"h":0.019607273878249454,"w":0.8296989440917969,"x":0.080005111061924289,"c":1,"t":"devices or applications suitable for hotel check-ins, for example, providing a practical alternative","y":0.75287753019539616},{"t":"to speaking traveller's English. The efficiency of the translator is less important than the social","h":0.016224188790560423,"w":0.81108830769856777,"y":0.77168141610867047,"c":1,"x":0.078028741267950369},{"t":"function. However, 'Professionals are less inclined to be patient in a conversation,' founder and","w":0.81519505818684901,"h":0.017540474838211861,"y":0.78924418607015301,"x":0.080082142246336807,"c":1},{"t":"CEO at Waverly Labs, Andrew Ochoa, observes. To redress this, Waverly is now preparing a","h":0.019784581907379195,"c":1,"x":0.080006952234991213,"w":0.79274337768554692,"y":0.8063800675554863},{"w":0.79278559366861989,"y":0.82339373021813334,"c":1,"h":0.019841368008503779,"t":"new model for professional applications, which entails performance improvements in speech","x":0.079995154720704995},{"x":0.077907921472996688,"t":"recognition, translation accuracy and the time it takes to deliver the translated speech.","h":0.021916517184547235,"y":0.84127923991264009,"w":0.73535853068033852,"c":1},{"y":0.92296511652055568,"w":0.026694043477376306,"t":"70","h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"x":0.078028748179176335},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218665204,"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1,"y":0.94166666659226195,"w":0.45294118245442705}],"h":3390}